https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.80,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Alabasta'ya VarışDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.80,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Alabasta'ya VarışDialogue: 1,0:01:54.51,0:01:58.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nanohana Alabasta KrallığıDialogue: 2,0:01:54.51,0:01:58.47,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nanohana Alabasta KrallığıDialogue: 50,0:02:10.61,0:02:12.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek burası Alabasta'daki şehirlerden biri.Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yemek!Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin, millet!Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.66,0:02:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İçgüdülerinizle değil, aklınızla hareket edin!Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hay hay, Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.79,0:02:25.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En çok duyması gereken kişi çoktan gitti.Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Restoran!Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buraya gel!Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.21,0:02:31.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece içgüdüyle hareket ediyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.30,0:02:32.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağız?Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenmeyin.Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.63,0:02:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En gürültülü yer neresiyse orada bulursun onu.Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.85,0:02:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bingo.Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.10,0:02:43.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öf! En azından kafasındaki ödülün farkında olmalı,Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.81,0:02:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hele böyle büyük bir ülkede!Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.06,0:02:48.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boşverin onu. Önce bir yemek yiyelim.Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.36,0:02:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonra stratejimizi belirleriz.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.53,0:02:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepsi aynı kafa...Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.53,0:03:00.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 3'ün gemisi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O ucube ölmemiş mi yani?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.50,0:03:05.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiç şüphesiz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.87,0:03:09.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemisi Mum-Mum Meyvesi'nin gücüyle çalışıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O piç burada mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.75,0:03:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kötü.Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.01,0:03:21.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nanohana Limanı, Alabasta KrallığıDialogue: 2,0:03:15.01,0:03:21.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nanohana Limanı, Alabasta KrallığıDialogue: 50,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Neler oluyor? Sorun ne?Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.56,0:03:29.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. Birisi restoranda yerken devrilip kalmış.Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Devrilmiş mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.94,0:03:34.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanırım restoranın sahibiyle muhabbet  ederken bir anda ölmüş.Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buralardan değilmiş.Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.70,0:03:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yolculuğu sırasında farkında olmadan çöl çileği yediğini düşünüyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çöl çileği mi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.16,0:03:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kırmızı çileğe benzeyen zehirli örümcekler.Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.62,0:03:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yanlışlıkla bir tane yersen bir kaç güne tahtalı köydesin.Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.04,0:03:55.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölümün ardından, zehir birkaç saat boyunca bulaşıcılığını koruduğu için...Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.59,0:03:58.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,kimse yanına da yaklaşamıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.18,0:04:02.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çölde ölümün nereden geleceğini bilemezsin.Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.35,0:04:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bakın! Hâlâ eti tutuyor. O pozisyonda donup kalması,Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.81,0:04:12.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,çöl çileği zehrinin ne kadar güçlü olduğunun kanıtı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.32,0:04:18.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Canlandı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.41,0:04:26.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İ-İyi misin?Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pardon.Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uyumuşum.Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.13,0:04:37.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Uyudun mu?! – Uyudun mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.26,0:04:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İ-İnanılmaz! Tam sohbetin ve yemeğin ortasında!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve yine yemeye başladı!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peki bu tantana ne?Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Öldüğünü düşündük! – Öldüğünü düşündük!Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.94,0:04:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada komedi gösterileri mi yapılıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.94,0:04:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yok, öyle değil. Neyse, iyi olduğuna sevindik.Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey! Yine uyuma! – Hey! Yine uyuma!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha? Ölmemiş mi yani?Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yanlış alarm.Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.05,0:05:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu çok iyi geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Söyleyin, bayım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.84,0:05:22.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne var?Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.43,0:05:24.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu adamı buralarda gördün mü?Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.89,0:05:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır şapkalı bir korsan...Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.06,0:05:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle halkın ortasında yediğine göre bayağı cesursun,Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.81,0:05:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal Korsanları, 2. Tümen Komutanı...Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.98,0:05:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace.Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.15,0:05:43.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Beyazsakal mı?! Beyazsakal Korsanları mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.12,0:05:47.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O andaval Beyazsakal Korsanları'ndan mı?Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sırtındaki dövmeyi tanıdım aslında!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O, Beyazsakal Korsanları'nın sembolü!Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada ne arıyor ki?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.00,0:05:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi meşhur bir korsan, bu ülkede ne arıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.64,0:06:06.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Küçük kardeşimi...Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:10.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace Beyazsakal Korsanları 2. Tümen KomutanıDialogue: 1,0:06:06.14,0:06:10.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace Beyazsakal Korsanları 2. Tümen KomutanıDialogue: 2,0:06:06.14,0:06:10.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Portgas D. Ace Beyazsakal Korsanları 2. Tümen KomutanıDialogue: 50,0:06:09.52,0:06:10.68,Main-207-,,0,0,7,,arıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.43,0:06:19.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Restoraaaaan!Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.03,0:06:24.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu ne? Havada garip bir koku var!Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.20,0:06:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Buldum! Bir restoran!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ee? Benden ne istiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usluca teslim olmanı.Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm. Onu yapamam.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben de öyle düşünmüştüm.Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu an başka bir korsanla uğraşıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.77,0:06:54.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dürüst olayım, senin peşinde değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman görmezden gel.Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapamam.Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.61,0:06:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben denizciyim,Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sense bir korsan.Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.07,0:07:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne aptalca bir gerekçe.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.87,0:07:09.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biraz eğlenelim o zaman.Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.92,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roket!Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir restoran! Sonunda buldum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yemek vakti! Açlıktan geberdim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İhtiyar! Yemek! Yemek! Yemek! Bol bol yemek!Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.61,0:07:48.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hadi! Hadi! Hadi! Yemek! Yemek! Yemek!Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.57,0:07:49.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.99,0:07:52.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunlar şahane!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:54.95,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu Arada Nanohana'nın DışındaDialogue: 1,0:07:50.03,0:07:54.95,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu Arada Nanohana'nın DışındaDialogue: 2,0:07:50.03,0:07:54.95,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu Arada Nanohana'nın DışındaDialogue: 50,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu tür giysiler favorim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.87,0:07:58.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alışveriş yapmanı istemiş olsam da Sanji-san,Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bunlar dansçı kızlar için değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve ikinize de çok yakıştı!Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.84,0:08:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sıradan günlük giysiler istemiştim…Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.47,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Dansçılar da sıradan kişiler!Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.47,0:08:09.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama önümüzde bir çöl var…Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.68,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenme!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.68,0:08:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yorulursanız, taşırım!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.60,0:08:14.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kafası basmıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.35,0:08:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama onlara kıyasla, siz haydut gibi görünüyorsunuz.Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin ne farkın var?Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.82,0:08:26.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pis kokuyor.Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu arada, neredeydin sen?Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.41,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Değişik yerlerde!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.41,0:08:30.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasta mı?Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.66,0:08:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, parfümün kokusu onu rahatsız ediyor.Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Parfüm mü?Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.04,0:08:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, doğru! Tony-kun'un burnu çok hassas!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Oh, bu... – Genelde kokuları ağırdır.Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.13,0:08:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana olan sevgim derinleşiyor, Mellorine!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hep böyle salak mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.51,0:08:48.47,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.47,0:08:53.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her neyse, ilk amacımız olan malzeme toplama işini hallettik!Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet...Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.39,0:08:57.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gideceğimiz yer Yuba mıydı?Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.64,0:09:02.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet ama önce çölü geçmemiz lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.06,0:09:06.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leziz! Buranın yemekleri çok güzel!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.48,0:09:10.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,E-Evet. Teşekkürler de...Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.57,0:09:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapabiliyorken kaçsan iyi olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Niye ki?Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.95,0:09:21.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ulan...!Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kim yaptı lan bunu?Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.42,0:09:27.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne oluyor lan?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.88,0:09:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amaç ne yani?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.01,0:09:39.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yemeğinizi böldüğüm için özür dilerim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hangi salak böyle bir şey yapar?Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.83,0:09:56.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lu...!Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.99,0:09:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luf–Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni arıyordum, Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.97,0:10:15.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek gerçekten Alabasta'ya geldin!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.93,0:10:22.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak yemeği!Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.07,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu adam...?Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.45,0:10:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen o duman adamsın! Burada ne yapıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şerefsiz...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.58,0:10:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ellerinize sağlık!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.63,0:10:47.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dur lan!Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.05,0:10:54.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bekle, Luffy! Benim ben!Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.38,0:10:58.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Dursana! Hey! Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.93,0:11:02.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ödeme yapmadılar...Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.35,0:11:06.52,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Durum fena! Lastik güçlerim  bu adama etki etmiyor bile!Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.52,0:11:08.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdilik kaçmam gerek!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.36,0:11:09.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tashigi!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.40,0:11:12.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,E-Evet, Albay Smoker?! Havluya mı ihtiyacınız var!?Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burası epey sıcak!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakala onu! Hasır Şapka'yı!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu durduracağım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.41,0:11:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tashigi! Askerleri topla!Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her yeri didik didik arayıp Hasır Şapkalar'ı bulun!Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Başüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.59,0:11:35.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güç sahibi kişiler çatışıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.59,0:11:35.26,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Vay!Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar! Yani...Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.51,0:11:45.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro bu şehirde!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.77,0:11:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyaz Yılan!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.94,0:11:57.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, nereye gitmiş olabilir?Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.15,0:12:01.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cidden! Kaptanımızın bir dadıya ihtiyacı var sanki!Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.45,0:12:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, durum iyi değil!Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.87,0:12:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çabuk tüymezsek başımız büyük belaya girecek.Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.62,0:12:08.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne belası?Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denizciler burada.Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.33,0:12:11.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denizciler mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.34,0:12:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy'yi ne kadar çabuk bulursak, burayı o kadar çabuk terk ederiz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.96,0:12:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Saklanın!Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.80,0:12:17.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Niye?! – Ne oluyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.76,0:12:21.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denizciler!Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Büyük bir kargaşa var gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.89,0:12:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçmasına izin vermeyin! Peşinden!Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.85,0:12:31.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Herhâlde aptal bir korsan şehirde koşturuyor falan.Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:36.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gel buraya, Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Sen miydin?! – Sen miydin?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.74,0:12:39.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.95,0:12:43.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?! Hepiniz mi oradasınız?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal! Peşindekilerden kurtul önce!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.25,0:12:48.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka korsanları! Oradalar!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peki, şimdi ne yapıyoruz?Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.38,0:12:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Elbette kaçacağız! – Çabuk! Gemiye!Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsunuz?! Dönelim hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ulan!Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.88,0:12:58.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Durun! Kaçmalarına izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geride durun!Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.22,0:13:01.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay!Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.51,0:13:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka benim!Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.05,0:13:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-Oha! Geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyaz Yumruk!Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.89,0:13:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benimsin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güneş Parlaması!Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.95,0:13:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine mi sen?Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.29,0:13:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pes et!Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen duman olabilirsin,Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ama ben ateşim.Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.54,0:13:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu sonuca bağlayamayacak kadar dengiz.Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.38,0:13:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan meyvesi güçleri mi varmış?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.09,0:13:43.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da kim?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.18,0:13:45.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.18,0:13:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir gram değişmemişsin, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.47,0:13:52.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace?! Sen misin?! Şeytan meyvesi mi yedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Alev-Alev Meyvesi!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay Smoker! Çevreyi kuşatıyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.86,0:14:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Konuşacak zaman yok! Kaçın! Ben yetişirim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunları bana bırakın!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Gidin! – Gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.03,0:14:05.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,T-Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi de Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kimdi o?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyaz...Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kıvılcım!Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.86,0:14:42.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne oluyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ev mi yanıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, o normal bir ateş değil!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne oluyor orada?Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.99,0:14:51.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alevin ve dumanın savaşı mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.33,0:14:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alev-Alev Meyvesi yediğini söylemişti.Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.29,0:15:00.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama Luffy! O herif gerçekten senin abin mi?Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! İsmi Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.17,0:15:06.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Abin olmasına şaşırmadım ama...Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'da ne işi var?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace korsan çünkü!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.76,0:15:13.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One Piece'i bulmak için benden üç yıl önce adamızdan ayrıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.64,0:15:15.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.36,0:15:22.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Neyse, hemen gemiye dönelim!Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.11,0:15:23.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakalanmadan kaçalım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hay hay, Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.41,0:15:34.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine de Ace'i burada görmeyi hiç beklemiyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.67,0:15:39.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yol burada ayrılıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.42,0:15:41.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, sola! Herkes duydu mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.30,0:15:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Nami-san nereye, ben oraya!Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeter be, sapık aşçı!Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.63,0:15:49.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Süper! Ateş iyice yükseldi!Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.80,0:15:54.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alevin ve dumanın savaşının bir sonu yok gerçekten.Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.52,0:15:57.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama bunun farkındaydık.Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar nereye gitti?Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.98,0:16:02.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kayboldular!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.11,0:16:04.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace de öyle! Onu da kaçırdık!Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.82,0:16:08.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'da nihayet Hasır Şapka'ya yaklaştım,Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.57,0:16:13.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ama Portgas D. Ace işin içine girdi.Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acele edip malzemeleri yükleyin! Hemen yola çıkıyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.33,0:16:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çabuk!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yelkenler fora!Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.92,0:16:27.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şey... Adaya yeni ayak basmıştık, hemen ayrılıyor muyuz?Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.67,0:16:32.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet. Bu şehir, ihtiyacımız olan malzemeler için kısa bir duraktı.Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.47,0:16:36.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sırada gemiyi nehir boyunca Alabasta'nın içine doğru ilerletmek var.Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.14,0:16:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdiki rotamız, Yeşil Şehir, Erumalu.Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.48,0:16:41.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Erumalu mu?Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.61,0:16:42.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çabuk!Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hızlanın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.27,0:16:45.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hazırız!Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.32,0:16:46.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Yelken açalım!Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.20,0:16:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanırım...Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.49,0:16:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Birini unuttuğumuz hissine kapıldım…Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok garip.Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nereye gitti bunlar?Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.34,0:17:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah be, demek seni salmak boşunaymış.Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.26,0:17:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uzun zaman oldu, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle, Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaç yıl geçti?Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.61,0:17:28.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bilmem.Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama Luffy, yöntemlerinden şaşmıyorsun,Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tıpkı çocukluğumuzdaki gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen de Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.03,0:17:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan meyvesi yemene şaşırdım ama onun haricinde aynısın!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.70,0:17:41.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tarlaya sızıp 100 tane karpuz yiyip...Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,çekirdekleri de mitralyöz gibi tükürüp kaçman gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.71,0:17:47.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu ben değil sen yaptın!Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.17,0:17:50.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hı hı, seni fena halde patakladılar!Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.01,0:17:53.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O sendin diyorum! Ben sadece izleyip güldüm!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.89,0:18:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Değişmemişiz demek ki!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.64,0:18:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle!Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.69,0:18:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,, Beni geçmişe götürdü!Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.61,0:18:07.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Desene...Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.03,0:18:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,arkadaşların seni aramıyor muydu?Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.15,0:18:11.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi de Ace, senin bu ülkede ne işin var?Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.66,0:18:14.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.36,0:18:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drum'da bıraktığım mesajı almadın mı yani?Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.70,0:18:19.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drum mı?Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.37,0:18:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, boşver. Çok önemli değil.Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.75,0:18:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ufak bir iş için buralardayım,Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.25,0:18:30.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seni de göreyim dedim.Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.63,0:18:31.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ufak iş mi?Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.09,0:18:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal Korsanları'na katıldım.Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.35,0:18:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal Korsanları mı?Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte Beyazsakal Korsanları'nın sembolü.Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.97,0:18:43.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim gururum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.14,0:18:43.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Beyazsakal'ın tayfasına katılsana.Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arkadaşların da gelebilir.Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.99,0:18:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.91,0:18:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorayım dedim.Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.99,0:19:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal, benim gördüğüm en büyük korsan.Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.37,0:19:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı olmasına yardım edeceğim...Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, sen olamayacaksın.Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorun yok! Sadece dövüşmemiz gerek!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.97,0:19:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle Korsanlar Kralı olacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hepsini bitirme, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şehirde bir karışıklık mı var?Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.90,0:19:36.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Smoker ve adamları gemiyi terk etti.Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tam aradığım fırsat.Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte kaçış şansım!Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.79,0:19:45.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 11.Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:51.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,m 144 147 b 144 147 157.7 195 157.7 195 b 165.8 224.1 170.3 253.1 173.2 283 b 173.2 283 176 309 176 309 b 176 309 176 317 176 317 b 176 317 177 329 177 329 b 177 329 177 355 177 355 b 177 355 