 TeşekküllüDialogue: 1,0:20:47.55,0:20:47.73,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,m 688.06 620.19 l 701.9 620.76 740.24 618.91 768.14 610.45 790.61 600.28 845.03 738.76 848.33 962.43 658.32 968.62 584.12 765.04 635.53 625.87Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.73,0:20:49.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,m 685.75 610.19 l 710.62 612.04 744.6 610.45 768.14 610.45 790.61 600.28 845.03 738.76 848.33 962.43 658.32 968.62 584.12 765.04 635.53 625.87Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.02,0:20:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace'i indirirsek, kesinlikle terfi alırız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aha! Okyanus!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.07,0:21:00.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemini görüyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.41,0:21:03.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaçacak yeriniz kalmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.66,0:21:04.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.74,0:21:06.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Orada!Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.58,0:21:11.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Buradayız! Millet!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.21,0:21:13.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Sen önden g–Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neyse.Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.67,0:21:18.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aa! Orada! O Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu buldum!Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.09,0:21:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neredeymiş?Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet. Bu kesinlikle onun aptal suratı.Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.80,0:21:24.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.93,0:21:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geldim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.77,0:21:34.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san! Tony-kun!Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.77,0:21:37.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hadi ama!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine mi?Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.90,0:21:43.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pardon, Sanji, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.03,0:21:48.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olur da hiç öğrenmiyorsun?! Seni burada deşsem yeridir!Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle! Başımıza açtığın belanın farkında mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.91,0:21:53.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Az kaptan gibi davran!Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.08,0:21:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Özür.Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.13,0:21:56.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aa, doğru. Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace mi?Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.17,0:21:59.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Abin seninle miydi?Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.13,0:22:02.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu orada bırakmak uygun mu?Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.64,0:22:06.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorun olmaz herhâlde. Ace çok güçlü!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.47,0:22:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güçlü mü?Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.64,0:22:12.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet. Eskiden Alev-Alev Meyvesi de yoktu,Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.35,0:22:15.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ama ona rağmen bir kere bile onu yenemedim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.19,0:22:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace işte o kadar güçlü!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.36,0:22:21.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yenemediğin kanlı canlı birisi mi var?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek ki asıl canavar abisiymiş.Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.70,0:22:27.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle! Kaybedip duruyordum ona!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.95,0:22:30.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama şimdi denesek, onu iyi döverdim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.62,0:22:33.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boş sallıyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.25,0:22:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kim...Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.55,0:22:39.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,kimi dövecekmiş?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.59,0:22:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Ace! Bahsettiğim arkadaşlarım bunlar!Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.93,0:22:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Küçük kardeşime göz kulak olduğunuz için teşekkür ederim.Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.81,0:22:50.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ha? Hiç önemli değil! – Ha? Hiç önemli değil!Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.14,0:22:55.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bazen dayanması zor biri olabiliyor ama...Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.35,0:22:57.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yok, hiçte bile. – Yok, hiçte bile.Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ona iyi bakın.Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İkiniz hasret giderirsiniz herhâlde.Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.74,0:23:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İçeri gelin. Çay yapayım size.Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.07,0:23:08.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, teşekkür ederim. Benim için zahmet etme.Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.87,0:23:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Beklenmedik bir şey bu…Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.87,0:23:16.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harbiden.Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.33,0:23:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy gibi hödük olur sanmıştım.Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.96,0:23:24.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu nezaketli adam Luffy'nin abisi olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.22,0:23:26.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hem çok nazik, hem de kardeşini önemsiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.47,0:23:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Abiler çok müthiş olabiliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.60,0:23:31.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Deniz şaşırtıyor insanı.Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.47,0:23:33.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Millet, durun bi'!Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.48,0:23:36.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gördün mü? Çok iyi değiller mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.19,0:23:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baroque Works! Milyarların gemileri bunlar!Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.78,0:23:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ateş Yumruk Ace! Hasır Şapka Luffy! Bizden kaçabileceğinizi mi sandınız?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.74,0:23:51.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baroque Works'ün milyarları ne yapabilir göstereceğiz size!Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.91,0:23:53.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine mi bunlar?Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.54,0:23:56.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy. O çöpleri ben temizlerim.Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.92,0:24:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacak ki?Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.59,0:24:02.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Özellikle o küçük tekneyle...Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.55,0:24:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal Korsanları'nın 2. Tümen Komutanı, neye benziyormuş görelim.Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.64,0:24:14.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geliyor! Ateş Yumruk Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.02,0:24:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dene de gör. Beş tane gemi var önünde!Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.77,0:24:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zıpladı!Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.07,0:24:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Ateş!Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.57,0:24:26.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu denize gömün!Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.25,0:24:36.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ateş Yumruk!Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.31,0:25:02.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oha!Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.44,0:25:02.44,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,H-Harika!Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.16,0:25:15.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay Smoker!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.33,0:25:20.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka Luffy ve tayfası, hiçbir yerde bulunamadı.Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.83,0:25:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen ne anladın bu işten, Tashigi?Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.67,0:25:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi onlarlaydı.Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.92,0:25:30.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi mi? Prenses Nefertari Vivi, Hasır Şapkalar'la mıydı?Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.18,0:25:32.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rehin tutuluyor olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.68,0:25:36.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prensesi kaçırmaları planlarının bir parçası olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.85,0:25:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayır, Vivi onlardan biri gibi davranıyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.19,0:25:44.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Prenses? Onlardan biri mi?Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.27,0:25:48.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkede bir şeyler dönüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.19,0:25:51.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay Smoker!Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.15,0:25:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Özür dilerim, efendim!Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.49,0:25:56.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bay 11'i, gemide bağlı hâlde ölü bulduk!Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.91,0:25:59.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'la ilgili de hâlâ bir iz bulamadık!Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.50,0:26:03.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Toplanın. Sanırım nereye gittiklerini biliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.08,0:26:06.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile'ı gözüne dikmiş.Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.50,0:26:08.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.09,0:26:10.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hükûmetin desteklediği...Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.72,0:26:12.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shichibukai olan korsan mı?Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.68,0:26:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shichibukai'den nefret ettiğimi biliyorsun, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.89,0:26:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Özellikle de o iğrenç heriften.Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.85,0:26:22.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Ama o, şu anda Denizciler ve hükûmetle aynı safta!Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.81,0:26:26.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O korsan hep kurnaz biriydi.Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.19,0:26:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yere yatıp hükûmetten af dilenecek bir tip değil o!Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.57,0:26:33.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tashigi! Bu dediğimi hatırla!Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.11,0:26:34.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mevkii fark etmeksizin...Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.95,0:26:36.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,korsan korsandır!Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.28,0:26:42.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile neredeyse Hasır Şapka da orada çıkacak.Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.41,0:26:45.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oraya vardığımızda her şey açıklığa kavuşacak.Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.29,0:26:48.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve bu sefer kaçamayacaksın, Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.80,0:26:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın!Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.50,0:26:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace de bizden birisi artık!Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.76,0:26:53.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şerefe!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.97,0:26:56.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne demek sizdenim?Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.85,0:27:00.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leziz yemeklere!Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.31,0:27:01.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şerefe!Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.06,0:27:02.18,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Şerefe!Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.06,0:27:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Endişelenme!Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.18,0:27:03.89,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Leziz içeceklere!Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.81,0:27:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her zaman içmeye bahane arıyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.89,0:27:05.15,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Şerefe!Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.15,0:27:06.81,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Leziz içeceklere!Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.81,0:27:07.44,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,İlaçlar iğrenç!Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.44,0:27:09.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İlaçlar iğrenç!Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.07,0:27:15.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace! Bize katılmayacağına emin misin?Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.95,0:27:18.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peşinde olduğum biri var.Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adı Karasakal.Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.91,0:27:23.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karasakal mı?Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.25,0:27:25.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drum Krallığı'na saldıran korsan.Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.88,0:27:30.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Önceden Beyazsakal'ın 2. tümenindeydi.Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.13,0:27:31.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adamlarımdan biriydi.Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.96,0:27:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama bir korsan için olası en kötü suçu işledi.Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.88,0:27:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tayfadan birisini öldürdü ve gemiden kaçtı.Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.01,0:27:42.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Komutanı olarak sorumluluk bende.Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.06,0:27:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O yüzden mi peşindesin?Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.60,0:27:48.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sandora Nehri'nin daha başındayız.Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.27,0:27:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Önce Erumalu'ya ineceğiz.Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.61,0:27:53.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonra Alabasta'nın içlerine doğru yol alıp Yuba’ya ulaşacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.49,0:27:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İsyancıların liderini burada bulacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.16,0:27:59.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum. Yuba'ya o zaman.Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.62,0:28:02.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san ve Vivi-chan nereye, ben oraya!Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.99,0:28:04.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Defol git, Aşkçı.Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.58,0:28:06.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?! Seni–Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.21,0:28:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her neyse! Bir süre beraber seyahat edeceğiz gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.33,0:28:12.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen, aynen! Abisi istediği kadar kalabilir!Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.42,0:28:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biraz eğlenelim, Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.88,0:28:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!